    <p>
      <b>Description</b>
    </p>
    <p>Writes simulation outputs to a CSV file path. Acts as a sink with file output behavior.</p>
    <p>
      <b>Ports</b>
    </p>
    <p>
      <b>Input(s)</b>
    </p>
